OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 01 OCT
OL,4,CCHANNELS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1992FSky Movies Gold begins
OL,7,Fbroadcasting. The channel aired classic
OL,8,Fmovies, from 4pm to 12am each day. It
OL,9,Freplaced The Comedy Channel.
OL,10,
OL,11,CG1993FQVC begins broadcasting in the
OL,12,FUK, from 2pm.
OL,13,
OL,14,CG1995FThe Disney Channel begins
OL,15,Fbroadcasting in the UK and Ireland, as
OL,16,Fsubscription-only.
