OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 01 OCT
OL,4,CCHANNELS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1996FA joint venture between Granada
OL,7,FTelevision and British Sky Broadcasting
OL,8,Flaunches four channels:
OL,9,
OL,10,F- Granada Plus: initially, the channel
OL,11,Fshowed programmes produced by Granada
OL,12,FTV and London Weekend TV, such as On
OL,13,Fthe Buses, Crown Court, The Comedians
OL,14,Fand The Wheeltappers and Shunters
OL,15,FSocial Club. The channel was replaced
OL,16,Fby ITV 3 in 2004.
OL,17,F- Granada Men and Motors: aimed at men,
OL,18,Ffocused on motoring and erotic content.
OL,19,F- Granada Good Life: women's lifestyle.
OL,20,F- Granada Talk TV: talk shows.
OL,21,
OL,22,
