OL,5,
OL,6,CG1998FSky Sports News begins
OL,7,Fbroadcasting, after a couple of months
OL,8,Fof internal trials.
OL,9,
OL,10,CG2007FVirgin 1 begins broadcasting,
OL,11,Freplacing Ftn. The channel was
OL,12,Fapparently positioned as a rival to Sky
OL,13,F1. Shows included Terminator: The Sarah
OL,14,FConnor Chronicles, The Riches and the
OL,15,FStar Trek franchise.
